'''Crushed''' is a [[debuff]] that lowers physical [[damage reduction]] by 15%. 

==Sources==
===Mods===
* {{il|Essence of Horror}}'s amulet mod {{ml|CrushOnHitChanceEssence1|display=verbose}}

