===Gems===
Level 5 {{il|Awakened Brutality Support}} gives 10% chance to Crush Enemies for 4 seconds on Hit

===Passive skills===
{{Query base passive skills
|where= passive_skill_stats.id LIKE "%Crush%"
}}
[[Mace Mastery]]: "Crush Enemies on hit with Maces and Sceptres" crushes on hit
==Items==

===Base Items===

{{Drop enabled base item table
|tables=item_stats
|join=items._pageID=item_stats._pageID
|where=
       item_stats.id LIKE "%crush%" OR items.stat_text LIKE "%Crushed%"
|large=1
|level=1
|stat=1
}}

===Unique items===
{{Drop enabled unique item table
|tables=item_stats
|join=items._pageID=item_stats._pageID
|where=
       item_stats.id LIKE "%crush%" OR items.name = "Glimpse of Chaos"
